  "title": "技能会贬值，真正该积累的是什么？",
  "transcript_quality": "source-unverified",
  "transcript_source_kind": "local-caption-copy",
  "units": [
    {
      "end_seconds": 2.58,
      "id": "cue-1",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 0.12,
      "text": "想要摆脱用时间换钱"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 5.78,
      "id": "cue-2",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "想要在 AI 时代\n真正构建自己的竞争力"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 7.62,
      "id": "cue-3",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "只要理解一个道理就行了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 10.74,
      "id": "cue-4",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 7.5600000000000005,
      "text": "那就是 skill\n技能会贬值"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 13.49,
      "id": "cue-5",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "然后资产 asset 会升值"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 14.85,
      "id": "cue-6",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 13.99,
      "text": "然后很多人就说啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 16.05,
      "id": "cue-7",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 14.79,
      "text": "怎么构建自己的资产啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 17.17,
      "id": "cue-8",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 16.39,
      "text": "你去做一个店"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 18.93,
      "id": "cue-9",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 17.19,
      "text": "如果这个店是赚钱的呢"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 19.73,
      "id": "cue-10",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 18.87,
      "text": "它就升值了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 21.73,
      "id": "cue-11",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 19.75,
      "text": "比如说我家旁边\n有一个奶茶店"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 22.77,
      "id": "cue-12",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 21.91,
      "text": "其实不好吃"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 23.65,
      "id": "cue-13",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 22.71,
      "text": "但是它转让费啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 25.49,
      "id": "cue-14",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 23.59,
      "text": "你把它的 lease（租约）\n接过来"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 27.57,
      "id": "cue-15",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 25.75,
      "text": "光是转让费就 15 万"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 27.97,
      "id": "cue-16",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 27.59,
      "text": "为什么"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 29.81,
      "id": "cue-17",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 27.91,
      "text": "因为它已经有一些\n老客户会来了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 32.77,
      "id": "cue-18",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 30.15,
      "text": "所以说它就可以去卖\n15 万美元"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 34.93,
      "id": "cue-19",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 32.95,
      "text": "因为它积累了\n这个客户基础"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 37.25,
      "id": "cue-20",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 34.87,
      "text": "这些客户基础\n才是它的 asset"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 39.88,
      "id": "cue-21",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 37.66,
      "text": "它的其他那些设备啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 40.967,
      "id": "cue-22",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 39.82,
      "text": "那些东西是可以折旧"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 42.207,
      "id": "cue-23",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 41.027,
      "text": "那我们到自己也是啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 44.287,
      "id": "cue-24",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 42.227,
      "text": "就是如果有人信任我们对吧"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 46.667,
      "id": "cue-25",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 44.227,
      "text": "然后有人愿意\n有问题来我们这儿解决"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 49.307,
      "id": "cue-26",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 47.007,
      "text": "有什么事儿来找我们商量\n等等这些东西"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 50.347,
      "id": "cue-27",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 49.247,
      "text": "那就是我们的资产"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 52.427,
      "id": "cue-28",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 50.607,
      "text": "所以说人和人之间的信任"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 54.667,
      "id": "cue-29",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 52.447,
      "text": "才是在这个时代\n最重要的资产"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 55.867,
      "id": "cue-30",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 54.927,
      "text": "想清楚这一点"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 58.267,
      "id": "cue-31",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 55.967,
      "text": "你所有的事情\n就想怎么样子去"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 60.667,
      "id": "cue-32",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 58.607,
      "text": "给更多的人\n构建信任就行了"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 62.587,
      "id": "cue-33",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 61.007,
      "text": "那也这是我为什么不喜欢"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 64.027,
      "id": "cue-34",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 62.527,
      "text": "就是很多人说啊"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 64.987,
      "id": "cue-35",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 63.967,
      "text": "我想要不打工"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 66.427,
      "id": "cue-36",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 64.927,
      "text": "然后我想要构建资产"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 68.027,
      "id": "cue-37",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 67.167,
      "text": "但是我不想做自媒体"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 68.667,
      "id": "cue-38",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 67.967,
      "text": "我不想露脸"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 70.765,
      "id": "cue-39",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 69.105,
      "text": "那你确实是可以做到的"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 72.045,
      "id": "cue-40",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 70.705,
      "text": "但是你要知道这个更难"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 74.365,
      "id": "cue-41",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 71.985,
      "text": "因为人脸就是一个\n非常容易识别的品牌"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 76.285,
      "id": "cue-42",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 74.625,
      "text": "你不构建自己的\n个人资产的话"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 77.645,
      "id": "cue-43",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 76.545,
      "text": "信任就是很难建立"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 79.005,
      "id": "cue-44",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 77.665,
      "text": "你就是很难无中生有地"
    },
    {
      "end_seconds": 80.445,
      "id": "cue-45",
      "speaker_id": "yuzheng",
      "speaker_name": "立正",
      "speaker_status": "reviewed-source-attribution",
      "speech_act": "statement",
      "start_seconds": 78.945,
      "text": "去构建出来属于你的资产"
    }
